# SimplyStream platform extension — ignore rules.
#
# When this tree was inlined in the engine, UE's root .gitignore (Binaries/,
# Intermediate/, Saved/, DerivedDataCache/, obj/) plus the engine fork's custom
# rules (emsdk/, Platforms/Binaries/) hid all build output and provisioned inputs.
# As a standalone submodule this tree inherits NONE of that, so the rules live here.

# --- Provisioned build inputs (overlaid at build time; not platform source) ---
/emsdk/
/simplystream-cli
Source/ThirdParty/Dawn/lib/

# --- UE build output (matches at any depth) ---
Binaries/
Intermediate/
Saved/
DerivedDataCache/

# --- .NET program build output (UBT / AutomationTool) ---
obj/

# --- OS / editor local files ---
.DS_Store
.clangd

# --- Node tooling ---
Tools/webgpu-verify/node_modules/
!*.mjs
Tools/webgpu-doctor/node_modules
